{"id":"vod_md_4899","vodId":"4899","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"浪客剑心","name_cn":"浪客剑心","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"94集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230914-1/8e2e32139f6d394b42bacd583f9853e7.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在维新政府建立之后的幕末时代。在一个小村庄里，生活着一位个性正直的少女神谷薰。村里有个名叫比留间五兵卫的男人，自称“拔刀斋”而到处作恶，阿薰为阻止五兵卫手持竹刀与之拼命，但却不是他的对手。五兵卫手起刀落，眼看阿薰性命难保，千钧一发之际，一位俊秀的红发剑士救下了她。 救下阿薰的剑心拿的是无法杀人的逆刃刀，却说自己就是杀人无数的“斩人拔刀斋”。阿薰对剑心产生了兴趣，她很想了解剑心的过去，想知道剑心为什么不再杀人，也希望剑心结束流浪生活，在自家的神谷道场安家，用剑去实现保护受苦受难之人的愿望……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-14 07:51:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":94,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/Vh1gru8x/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/43vDfvx5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/YExdzKRR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/VoGDPzoZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/Q71FyaBm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/RRiPoYHO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/isjrRdAC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/8GUDLDCD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/co90TOQx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/GU6OM7rg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/dp1zqxhK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/xdowWq6U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/7ga2DCyO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/wSzhlHrJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/HI8HIIP4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.modujx10.co